Package: libfdk-aac2
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Fraunhofer FDK AAC Codec Library - runtime files
 The FDK AAC Codec Library For Android contains an encoder and decoder
 implementation of the Advanced Audio Coding (AAC) audio codec family
 (AAC-LC, HE-AAC, HE-AAC v2, AAC-ELD, and the DRM and USAC/xHE-AAC decoding
 tools).
 .
 This package contains the files needed to run a program compiled using
 The Fraunhofer FDK AAC Codec Library.

Package: libfdk-aac-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: non-free/libdevel
Depends:
 libfdk-aac2 (= ${binary:Version}),
 pkg-config,
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Fraunhofer FDK AAC Codec Library - development files
 The FDK AAC Codec Library For Android contains an encoder and decoder
 implementation of the Advanced Audio Coding (AAC) audio codec family.
 .
 This package contains the files needed to compile and statically link
 against the Fraunhofer FDK AAC Codec Library.

Package: libfdk-xhe-aac0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Fraunhofer FDK Extended HE-AAC (xHE-AAC) encoder - runtime files
 The Fraunhofer FDK Extended High Efficiency AAC encoder implements the
 xHE-AAC (USAC) audio codec, including the loudness and dynamic range control
 tools. Decoding xHE-AAC is done with libfdk-aac2.
 .
 This package contains the files needed to run a program compiled using
 the encoder library.

Package: libfdk-xhe-aac-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: non-free/libdevel
Depends:
 libfdk-xhe-aac0 (= ${binary:Version}),
 pkg-config,
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Fraunhofer FDK Extended HE-AAC (xHE-AAC) encoder - development files
 The Fraunhofer FDK Extended High Efficiency AAC encoder implements the
 xHE-AAC (USAC) audio codec.
 .
 This package contains the files needed to compile and statically link
 against the xHE-AAC encoder library.

Package: aac-enc
Architecture: any
Depends:
  libfdk-aac2 (= ${binary:Version}),
  libfdk-xhe-aac0 (= ${binary:Version}),
  ${shlibs:Depends},
  ${misc:Depends}
Section: non-free/sound
Description: Fraunhofer FDK AAC Codec Library - frontend binaries
 The FDK AAC Codec Library For Android contains an encoder and decoder
 implementation of the Advanced Audio Coding (AAC) audio codec family.
 .
 This package contains frontend binaries: aac-enc encodes WAVE files to AAC,
 aac-dec decodes AAC to WAVE, and xhe-aac-enc encodes WAVE files to xHE-AAC,
 all using the Fraunhofer FDK AAC Codec Library.
